### 4.5 Conclusion

To remove the pileup in angular correlations, different methods are implemented. Run 2010 Au-Au collision data needed different techniques to remove pileup compared to run 2001/2004 data. A cut of 4\(\sigma\) in global versus primary track distribution was found to be optimal. And for run 2011 with pre and post-pileup trigger protection, the vertex ranking cut and Duncan's pileup filter along with the filter efficiency correction procedure were found to be optimal.

